{{Quote|You need a loan. I heard about the rathtars. King Prana's not happy.|[[Maz Kanata]] to Han Solo|<ref name="VIInovel">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens (novelization)|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' novelization]]</ref>}}
'''Grevoth Prana IX''' was a [[Gender|male]] individual who served as a [[king]] of the [[Kaboryth Cluster|Kaboryth cluster]].<ref name="Scum and Villainy Case Files" /> A pompous and conceited monarch, he was also a collector and trader of exotic and dangerous creatures, which he kept in his own expansive [[zoo]]. He had a longstanding rivalry with another royal, [[Regent]] [[Solculvis]] of the [[Mol'leaj system]], who maintained a similar facility.<ref name="TFA VD" /> At the [[time]] of the [[Cold War|conflict]] between the [[First Order]] and the [[Resistance]], Prana hired the [[smuggler]] [[Han Solo]] to collect three [[rathtar]]s, dangerous tentacled predators,<ref name="RathtarDB">{{Databank|rathtar|Rathtar}}</ref> for his personal zoo in an effort to outdo Solculvis. When Solo failed to deliver the rathtars, however, Prana was left unhappy and word spread as far as [[Takodana]].<ref name="VIInovel" />

